//  command: ##Below is a generic way to populate the OCC, use display_spec to fill in using GUI
//  command: ##To the OCC - scan_enable and shift_capture_clock gets connected automatically
//  command: ## Modify below to your specific design requirements
//  command: set id_clk_list [list     clk clk  ]
